                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND DRAHTLOSES KOMMUNIKATIONSENDGERÄT ZUM SENDEN/EMPFANGEN EINES RAHMENS IN EINEM DRAHTLOSEN KOMMUNIKATIONSSYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET TERMINAL DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL POUR ÉMETTRE/RECEVOIR UNE TRAME DANS UN SYSTÈME DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND WIRELESS COMMUNICATION TERMINAL FOR TRANSMITTING/RECEIVING FRAME IN WIRELESS COMMUNICATION SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A non-access point station, non-AP STA, configured to operate in a wireless communication system, comprises: a communication module; and a processor configured to control the communication module, wherein the processor is configured to: receive a management frame including i) a target wake time, TWT, element related to scheduling a restricted TWT service period, R-TWT SP, and ii) a quiet element related to a quiet interval from an AP, wherein the TWT element includes a TWT request type field including a specific field indicating a type of a traffic transmitted within the R-TWT SP, and transmit a low-latency traffic within the R-TWT SP when the type of the traffic indicated by the specific field is the low-latency traffic, wherein the quiet interval is ignored based on whether the quiet interval overlaps with the R-TWT SP.</p>
            </abstract>
